{"name":"Ishau","status":"ok","title":"Ishau","pageId":79555,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Ishau\" title=\"Category:Maps of Ishau\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Ishau</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ToA5e-p64_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ToA5e-p64-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ruins<br/><small><b>Formerly:</b></small> Village</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUmVmdWdlX0JheT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Refuge Bay (page does not exist)\">Refuge Bay</span>, <a href=\"/wiki/Chult\" title=\"Chult\">Chult</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Ishau</b> was a sunken village located at the bottom of <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUmVmdWdlX0JheT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Refuge Bay (page does not exist)\">Refuge Bay</span> in <a href=\"/wiki/Chult\" title=\"Chult\">Chult</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ToA5e-p64_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ToA5e-p64-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ishau?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Periodically, <a href=\"/wiki/Sea_hag\" title=\"Sea hag\">sea hags</a> navigated through the ruins looking for treasure or the remains of the dead.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ToA5e-p64_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ToA5e-p64-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ishau?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After it sunk, Ishau was home to <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Reef_shark\" title=\"Reef shark\">reef</a> and <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Hunter_shark\" title=\"Hunter shark\">hunter sharks</a>, along with aquatic <a href=\"/wiki/Dinosaur\" title=\"Dinosaur\">dinosaurs</a> called <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Plesiosaur\" title=\"Plesiosaur\">plesiosaurs</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ToA5e-p64_1-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ToA5e-p64-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ishau?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"></span></td>\n<td><i>This Realmslore article about a geographical location is a <a class=\"extiw\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:stub\" title=\"wikipedia:Wikipedia:stub\">stub</a>.  You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by <a class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ishau?action=edit\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\